<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Evaluation results on original texts (encoded as <span id="A2.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">privacy/utility</span>). Tasks requiring a backbone LLM (<img src="2602.20743v1/img/google.png" id="A2.T3.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:13/13;" width="13" height="13" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"> Gemini-2.5-flash) are marked with <math id="A2.T3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
